-- Recovery:   Greenfield. Roll back by dropping the schema objects below (DROP TABLE ... CASCADE,
--             DROP TYPE "UserStatus", DROP FUNCTION audit_logs_block_mutation) or recreating the
--             local dev database. Never do this against a database holding real data.
-- Hand-written sections (not generated by Prisma) are marked "MANUAL" below.

